            <dct:description xml:lang="en">Data is requested from companies, associations, and institutional bodies of the General State Administration and the Autonomous Communities regarding activity parameters and variables, information on algorithms and emission factors, and, where applicable, on measured or estimated emissions and, in general, the information necessary for applying the methods selected for each activity. The emissions from each activity are verified and calculated according to the IPCC guidelines. Successive quality controls are carried out throughout the process. For more information, see Chapter 1 of the NID, at https://www.miteco.gob.es/es/calidad-y-evaluacion-ambiental/temas/sistema-espanol-de-inventario-sei-.html.</dct:description>
